    <!-- Override Fossify promotion strings from fossify-commons library.
         These are deliberately set to empty/suppressed values so that:
         1. The "All Fossify apps" section label in CustomizationActivity is not shown.
         2. The "Apply theme to all Fossify Apps" text is not shown.
         3. The "Requires Fossify Thank You" subtitle is not shown.
         4. Purchase/donation dialog text is neutralized.
         The apply_to_all_holder is already GONE by default in the layout and is only
         made visible by showOrHideThankYouFeatures() when thank you IS installed, so
         these overrides complete the removal of all visible Fossify promotion UI.
    -->
